#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:2
msgid "Logical & bitwise instructions"
msgstr "Logische en bitsgewijze instructies"

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:5
msgid "Document conventions"
msgstr "Documentconventies"

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:7
msgid ""
"Notation: ``Rd, Rn`` denote ARM registers R0-R7 except in the case of the "
"special instructions where R0-R15 may be used. ``Rn<a-b>`` denotes an ARM "
"register whose contents must lie in range ``a <= contents <= b``. In the "
"case of instructions with two register arguments, it is permissible for them"
" to be identical. For example the following will zero R0 (Python ``R0 ^= "
"R0``) regardless of its initial contents."
msgstr ""
"Notatie: ``Rd, Rn`` duiden de ARM-registers R0-R7 aan, behalve in het geval "
"van de speciale instructies waar R0-R15 mag worden gebruikt. ``Rn<a-b>`` "
"duidt een ARM-register aan waarvan de inhoud in het bereik ``a <= contents "
"<= b`` moet liggen. In het geval van instructies met twee register-"
"argumenten is het toegestaan dat deze identiek zijn. Het volgende zal "
"bijvoorbeeld R0 nullen (Python ``R0 ^= R0``\\ ) ongeacht de oorspronkelijke "
"inhoud."

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:13
msgid "eor(r0, r0)"
msgstr "eor(r0, r0)"

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:15
msgid "These instructions affect the condition flags except where stated."
msgstr ""
"Deze instructies beïnvloeden de conditievlaggen, behalve waar anders "
"aangegeven."

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:18
msgid "Logical instructions"
msgstr "Logische instructies"

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:20
msgid "and\\_(Rd, Rn) ``Rd &= Rn``"
msgstr "and\\_(Rd, Rn) ``Rd &= Rn``"

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:21
msgid "orr(Rd, Rn) ``Rd |= Rn``"
msgstr "orr(Rd, Rn) ``Rd |= Rn``"

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:22
msgid "eor(Rd, Rn) ``Rd ^= Rn``"
msgstr "eor(Rd, Rn) ``Rd ^= Rn``"

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:23
msgid "mvn(Rd, Rn) ``Rd = Rn ^ 0xffffffff`` i.e. Rd = 1's complement of Rn"
msgstr ""
"mvn(Rd, Rn) ``Rd = Rn ^ 0xffffffff`` d.w.z. Rd = 1's complement van Rn"

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:24
msgid "bic(Rd, Rn) ``Rd &= ~Rn`` bit clear Rd using mask in Rn"
msgstr "bic(Rd, Rn) ``Rd &= ~Rn`` wis bits van Rd met het masker in Rn"

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:26
msgid ""
"Note the use of \"and\\_\" instead of \"and\", because \"and\" is a reserved"
" keyword in Python."
msgstr ""
"Merk het gebruik van \"and\\_\" op in plaats van \"and\", omdat \"and\" een "
"gereserveerd sleutelwoord is in Python."

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:29
msgid "Shift and rotation instructions"
msgstr "Schuif- en rotatie-instructies"

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:31
msgid "lsl(Rd, Rn<0-31>) ``Rd <<= Rn``"
msgstr "lsl(Rd, Rn<0-31>) ``Rd <<= Rn``"

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:32
msgid "lsr(Rd, Rn<1-32>) ``Rd = (Rd & 0xffffffff) >> Rn`` Logical shift right"
msgstr ""
"lsr(Rd, Rn<1-32>) ``Rd = (Rd & 0xffffffff) >> Rn`` Logische schuif naar "
"rechts"

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:33
msgid "asr(Rd, Rn<1-32>) ``Rd >>= Rn`` arithmetic shift right"
msgstr "asr(Rd, Rn<1-32>) ``Rd >>= Rn`` rekenkundige schuif naar rechts"

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:34
msgid ""
"ror(Rd, Rn<1-31>) ``Rd = rotate_right(Rd, Rn)`` Rd is rotated right Rn bits."
msgstr ""
"ror(Rd, Rn<1-31>) ``Rd = rotate_right(Rd, Rn)`` Rd wordt Rn bits naar rechts"
" geroteerd."

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:36
msgid ""
"A rotation by (for example) three bits works as follows. If Rd initially "
"contains bits ``b31 b30..b0`` after rotation it will contain ``b2 b1 b0 b31 "
"b30..b3``"
msgstr ""
"Een rotatie over (bijvoorbeeld) drie bits werkt als volgt. Als Rd "
"aanvankelijk de bits ``b31 b30..b0`` bevat, bevat het na rotatie ``b2 b1 b0 "
"b31 b30..b3``"

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:40
msgid "Special instructions"
msgstr "Speciale instructies"

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:42
msgid "Condition codes are unaffected by these instructions."
msgstr "Conditiecodes worden niet beïnvloed door deze instructies."

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:44
msgid "clz(Rd, Rn) ``Rd = count_leading_zeros(Rn)``"
msgstr "clz(Rd, Rn) ``Rd = count_leading_zeros(Rn)``"

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:46
msgid ""
"count_leading_zeros(Rn) returns the number of binary zero bits before the "
"first binary one bit in Rn."
msgstr ""
"count_leading_zeros(Rn) retourneert het aantal binaire nul-bits vóór de "
"eerste binaire één-bit in Rn."

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:48
msgid "rbit(Rd, Rn) ``Rd = bit_reverse(Rn)``"
msgstr "rbit(Rd, Rn) ``Rd = bit_reverse(Rn)``"

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:50
msgid ""
"bit_reverse(Rn) returns the bit-reversed contents of Rn. If Rn contains bits"
" ``b31 b30..b0`` Rd will be set to ``b0 b1 b2..b31``"
msgstr ""
"bit_reverse(Rn) retourneert de bitomgekeerde inhoud van Rn. Als Rn de bits "
"``b31 b30..b0`` bevat, wordt Rd ingesteld op ``b0 b1 b2..b31``"

#: ../../reference/asm_thumb2_logical_bit.rst:53
msgid ""
"Trailing zeros may be counted by performing a bit reverse prior to executing"
" clz."
msgstr ""
"Achterliggende nullen kunnen worden geteld door een bitomkering uit te "
"voeren voordat clz wordt uitgevoerd."
